+        // Still not there. A name brought in by `import p::*` is recorded by
+        // the scanner, which is the only place the parser's scope table --
+        // and so the wildcard import -- is still alive. It leaves the
+        // package-qualified name in ID_verilog_import; note that ID_scope is
+        // NOT usable here, because the alias the import creates takes its
